{"seq":1,"at":"2026-09-17","kind":"imported","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1240"},"reason":"Article of the Quiztopia bank (written for card c104): researched and transcribed in September 2026, converted to the quiz platform on 2026-10-20.","by":"Quiztopia import","ref":"quiz-archive/transcripts/quiztopia/c104.json"},
{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1240"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge film-media/film","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/film-media__film.g3.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",662],["+","Some records are firsts rather than totals. For more than eighty years no woman won the Oscar for Best Director, and only three had even been nominated. That changed on 7 March 2010, when Kathryn Bigelow won for \"The Hurt Locker\", her tense drama about a US Army bomb-disposal team in Iraq – beating, among others, her former husband James Cameron and his \"Avatar\". "],["=",2],["+","film also won Best Picture. Chloé Zhao (2021) and Jane Campion (2022) have since followed her.\n\nThe "],["=",253],["+","\n| First woman to win Best Director | Kathryn Bigelow | 2010 |"],["=",62]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",652],["+","Manche Rekorde sind Premieren statt Summen. Mehr als achtzig Jahre lang gewann keine Frau den Oscar für die beste Regie, und nur drei waren überhaupt nominiert worden. Das änderte sich am 7. März 2010, als Kathryn Bigelow für „Tödliches Kommando – The Hurt Locker“ gewann, ihr packendes Drama über einen Bombenentschärfungstrupp der US-Armee im Irak – unter anderem gegen ihren früheren Ehemann James Cameron und dessen „Avatar“. "],["=",2],["+","Film gewann auch als bester Film. Seither sind ihr Chloé Zhao (2021) und Jane Campion (2022) gefolgt.\n\nDer "],["=",251],["+","\n| Erste Frau mit dem Regie-Oscar | Kathryn Bigelow | 2010 |"],["=",58]]}]},
